[b]0.2.8[/b]
[list]
[*]The main-menu home page, Esc pause menu, and settings now keep the mouse cursor visible, making it easier to turn touchscreen mode off. Other pages retain touch controls.
[*]Opening the pause menu from combat no longer moves the mouse pointer away.
[*]Clear stale card tips when a touchscreen selection opens a preview, preventing the previous card's tips from remaining over the new screen.
[/list]

[list]
[*]主菜单首页、Esc 暂停菜单和设置页现在保留鼠标光标，方便随时关闭触屏模式。其他页面继续沿用触屏操作。
[*]从战斗中打开暂停菜单时，不再自动挪动鼠标指针。
[*]触屏选牌打开预览后，会清理被遮挡卡牌的旧提示，避免它们残留在新界面上。
[/list]
